<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated: September 2026</p>

<h2>1. The marketplace</h2>
<p>Tattoo Art Customs sells original tattoo designs (premade and custom) and memberships for customers, design artists, and tattoo shops.</p>

<h2>2. Pricing</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Premade designs: <strong>$75</strong> regular, <strong>$50</strong> during the Saturday sale (Saturday 7 PM – Sunday 5 AM Central).</li>
  <li>Custom designs: <strong>$150</strong>, 50% deposit due at order, balance on delivery. Delivery within 48 hours of the paid deposit.</li>
  <li>Memberships: Customer $5/month · Design artist $5/month · Tattoo shop $99.99/year.</li>
</ul>

<h2>3. All sales are final</h2>
<p>All sales, subscriptions, and memberships are <strong>final — no refunds</strong>. Digital designs are delivered as files and cannot be returned.</p>

<h2>4. Contact stays on the site</h2>
<p>Customers and design artists may not post off-site contact information anywhere on the site — no email addresses, phone numbers, street addresses, social media handles or DM info, personal websites, or payment information. Verified and subscribed tattoo shops are the sole exception and may post <strong>only</strong>: business location, appointment requirements, and business hours.</p>

<h2>5. Off-site sales</h2>
<p>Any sale arranged or completed outside this site connected to your membership will result in <strong>membership/subscription cancellation with no refund</strong>.</p>

<h2>6. Artist payouts</h2>
<p>Design artists earn 60% commission per sale of their designs; referring tattoo shops earn 20% on verified sales they refer. Payouts require a registered account, an active paid subscription, and a configured payout method — otherwise proceeds remain with the site. Commission splits are shown to artists and shops in their dashboards only and are never shown to customers.</p>

<h2>7. Acceptable use</h2>
<p>No spam, no harassment, no uploading content you do not own or have rights to sell. We may remove content or suspend accounts that break these terms.</p>
